-- 登记: A09 | 语义: 把 EQ-DESC 的 DESC 按 setup 的原值再写一遍再 SAVEWORK。预期字符串同值早退，RVM 不变 | expected_net: unchanged | restore 搭档: attr/desc_same_restore.mac
-- 字符串与 common/setup_8000.mac 里 NEW EQUIPMENT /AIOS-SUITE-EQ-DESC 的 DESC 同一句
ALPHA LOG "{{LOG_PATH}}" OVER
$P SUITE-ATTR-DESC-SAME-APPLY-ALIVE
/AIOS-SUITE-EQ-DESC
Q REF
Q NAME
Q DESC
DESC 'AIOS suite desc same'
Q DESC
SAVEWORK 'AIOS suite attr/desc_same apply: EQ-DESC DESC rewritten unchanged'
$P SUITE-ATTR-DESC-SAME-APPLY-DONE
ALPHA LOG END
